            <note corresp="#d556-f3" n="7" xml:id="d556-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed; but see telegrams Nos. 4 and 6, January 12 and 16, from the
                    Ambassador in Cuba, <ref target="#pg563">pp. 563</ref> and <ref target="#pg564"
                        >564</ref>.</p>
            </note>
